<template>
  <div class="cb-page import-wizard"><div class="wizard-shell">
    <header class="wizard-header"><v-btn variant="text" prepend-icon="mdi-arrow-left" @click="backToPanel">Voltar</v-btn><div><p class="eyebrow">Importação da competência</p><h1>{{ competenceLabel }}</h1></div><v-chip size="small" variant="tonal">Etapa {{ step }} de 4</v-chip></header>
    <v-progress-linear :model-value="step*25" color="primary" height="6" rounded aria-label="Progresso da importação" />
    <alert-strip v-if="errorMessage" variant="info" :description="errorMessage" />
    <main class="wizard-card cb-card">
      <div v-if="loading" class="wizard-state" role="status"><v-progress-circular indeterminate /><p>Carregando revisão…</p></div>
      <template v-else-if="published">
        <v-icon color="success" size="52">mdi-check-circle-outline</v-icon><h2>Lote adicionado à base editável</h2><p>Os itens deste lote agora participam da base da competência. Você ainda pode visualizar, substituir ou retirar o lote antes da publicação financeira do resultado.</p><dl class="summary"><div><dt>Fontes</dt><dd>{{ publication?.sourceCount ?? review?.selectedSourceCount }}</dd></div><div><dt>Itens</dt><dd>{{ publication?.itemCount ?? totalCandidates }}</dd></div></dl><div class="completion-actions"><v-btn color="primary" @click="backToPanel">Voltar ao painel</v-btn><v-btn variant="tonal" @click="startAdditionalImport">Preparar outro lote</v-btn></div>
      </template>
      <template v-else-if="expiredReview">
        <v-icon color="warning" size="48">mdi-clock-alert-outline</v-icon><p class="eyebrow">Revisão expirada</p><h2>Inicie uma nova revisão</h2><p>O prazo de 30 dias terminou. Nenhum staging ou decisão expirada pode ser publicado, e nenhum fato financeiro foi criado.</p><v-btn color="primary" @click="startNewReview">Começar nova revisão</v-btn>
      </template>
      <template v-else-if="needsResumeIntent">
        <p class="eyebrow">Retomar com segurança</p><h2>A revisão foi preservada</h2><p>O arquivo não fica armazenado. Confirme novamente a intenção de acessar dados protegidos. Se o staging expirou, o mesmo workbook será solicitado e seu fingerprint será conferido.</p><div v-if="progress?.stagingExpired" class="notice"><strong>O staging expirou</strong><p>As decisões sanitizadas continuam disponíveis. Reenvie o mesmo arquivo para reconstruir somente os candidatos compatíveis.</p></div><v-checkbox v-model="sensitiveConfirmed" label="Entendo que acessarei dados protegidos desta importação" hide-details /><v-btn color="primary" :disabled="!sensitiveConfirmed" :loading="acting" @click="resumeReview">Retomar revisão</v-btn>
      </template>
      <template v-else-if="needsWorkbookRecovery">
        <p class="eyebrow">Retomar os dados de origem</p><h2>Selecione novamente o mesmo workbook</h2><p>Para analisar ou alterar esta fonte, precisamos reler o mesmo arquivo. Os bytes não foram armazenados. O CoBudget conferirá o fingerprint e reaplicará apenas decisões compatíveis; a intenção protegida desta revisão continua válida no servidor.</p><v-file-input v-model="workbookInput" accept=".xlsx,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet" label="Mesmo workbook XLSX" prepend-icon="mdi-file-excel-outline" /><v-btn color="primary" :disabled="!selectedFile" :loading="acting" @click="recoverWorkbook">Continuar revisão</v-btn><v-btn variant="text" color="error" :disabled="acting" @click="abandonReview">Abandonar esta revisão</v-btn>
      </template>
      <template v-else-if="step===1">
        <p class="eyebrow">Dados de origem</p><h2>Selecione o workbook</h2><p>O arquivo permanece somente nesta sessão do navegador. A leitura identifica fontes conhecidas; ainda não cria itens financeiros.</p><v-checkbox v-model="sensitiveConfirmed" label="Entendo que acessarei dados protegidos nesta leitura" hide-details /><v-file-input v-model="workbookInput" accept=".xlsx,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet" label="Workbook XLSX" prepend-icon="mdi-file-excel-outline" :disabled="acting" /><div v-if="ownerSensitiveAccessNeeded" class="notice" role="status"><strong>Habilite o acesso protegido deste fechamento</strong><p>A confirmação acima registra sua intenção. Como proprietário, habilite a exceção temporária auditável antes de ler o workbook.</p><v-btn color="primary" size="small" :disabled="!sensitiveConfirmed" :loading="enablingOwnerSensitiveAccess" @click="enableOwnerSensitiveAccess">Habilitar leitura protegida</v-btn></div><v-btn color="primary" :disabled="!selectedFile||!sensitiveConfirmed" :loading="acting" @click="inventoryWorkbook">Identificar fontes</v-btn>
      </template>
      <template v-else-if="step===2 && configuringSheet && closing">
        <closing-source-profile-configuration :closing="closing" :sheet="configuringSheet" @saved="handleSourceProfileSaved" @cancel="configuringSheet=null" />
      </template>
      <template v-else-if="step===2 && !currentSheet">
        <p class="eyebrow">Fontes do workbook</p><h2>Escolha as fontes que entram neste lote</h2><p>Um lote reúne uma ou mais fontes na base editável desta competência. As fontes deixadas de fora não entram neste lote. A publicação financeira acontece somente depois de calcular e revisar o resultado.</p>
        <details class="operational-guide"><summary>Como funcionam revisões e correções antes do cálculo</summary><ol><li>Prepare apenas as fontes que deseja materializar juntas.</li><li>Resolva participantes, linhas inválidas e repetições durante a revisão.</li><li>Descarte o staging e recomece se a seleção ou o arquivo estiver errado.</li><li>Depois de materializar, confira, substitua ou retire o lote pelo painel da competência.</li><li>O cálculo usa todos os lotes ativos da base editável.</li></ol></details>
        <div v-if="alreadyPublishedSheets.length" class="published-list"><strong>Já presentes na base desta competência</strong><p>Você decide se novos itens desta fonte entram em outro lote; itens já materializados não são duplicados.</p><ul><li v-for="sheet in alreadyPublishedSheets" :key="sheet.sheetName"><v-icon color="success">mdi-check-circle-outline</v-icon><div><strong>{{ sheet.sheetName }}</strong><small>{{ additionalSheetNames.includes(sheet.sheetName)?'Novos itens selecionados; entrarão neste lote':'Fora deste lote; base atual preservada' }}</small></div><v-btn size="small" variant="text" @click="toggleAdditionalSheet(sheet.sheetName)">{{ additionalSheetNames.includes(sheet.sheetName)?'Deixar fora deste lote':'Incluir novos itens neste lote' }}</v-btn></li></ul></div>
        <ul class="source-list"><li v-for="sheet in selectedSheets" :key="sheet.sheetName"><v-icon color="success">mdi-check-circle-outline</v-icon><div><strong>{{ sheet.sheetName }}</strong><small>{{ sheet.nonEmptyDataRows }} linha(s) materiais · {{ sheet.recommendedProfileName }} · entrará neste lote</small></div><v-btn size="small" variant="text" @click="excludeSheet(sheet.sheetName)">Deixar fora deste lote</v-btn></li></ul>
        <div v-for="sheet in reviewSheets" :key="sheet.sheetName" class="notice" role="status"><strong>{{ sheet.sheetName }} {{ sheetStatus(sheet)==='STRUCTURE_CHANGED'?'teve a estrutura alterada':'precisa de revisão' }}</strong><p>{{ sheet.detail }} Nenhuma linha desta aba será preparada até a pendência indicada ser resolvida.</p><div class="inline-actions"><v-btn size="small" variant="tonal" @click="configureSheet(sheet)">{{ sheetStatus(sheet)==='STRUCTURE_CHANGED'?'Revisar perfil':'Configurar fonte e perfil' }}</v-btn><v-btn size="small" variant="text" @click="excludeSheet(sheet.sheetName)">Não incluir neste lote</v-btn></div></div>
        <div v-if="consolidationSheets.length" class="consolidation-list"><strong>Sugestões de consolidação ou apoio</strong><p>A classificação é uma sugestão baseada na estrutura, nunca apenas no nome da aba. Confirme se cada aba deve ficar fora do cálculo ou revise-a como fonte.</p><ul><li v-for="sheet in consolidationSheets" :key="sheet.sheetName"><v-icon>mdi-table-eye</v-icon><div><strong>{{ sheet.sheetName }}</strong><small>{{ sheet.detail }}</small></div><div class="inline-actions"><v-btn size="small" variant="tonal" @click="configureSheet(sheet)">Revisar classificação</v-btn><v-btn size="small" variant="text" @click="excludeSheet(sheet.sheetName)">Não incluir neste lote</v-btn></div></li></ul></div>
        <div v-if="excludedSheets.length" class="muted-list"><strong>Fora deste lote</strong><span>{{ excludedSheets.join(', ') }}</span></div>
        <v-btn color="primary" :disabled="!selectedSheets.length" @click="beginSourceReview">Revisar fontes deste lote</v-btn>
      </template>
      <template v-else-if="step===2 && currentSheet && closing">
        <div class="source-progress"><div><p class="eyebrow">Fonte {{ currentSourceIndex+1 }} de {{ selectedSheets.length }}</p><h2>{{ currentSheet.sheetName }}</h2></div><v-chip size="small" :color="currentSourceReady?'success':'warning'" variant="tonal">{{ currentSourceReady?'Pronta':'Em revisão' }}</v-chip></div>
        <guided-tabular-import-review :key="currentSheet.recommendedProfileId||currentSheet.sheetName" :closing="closing" :file="selectedFile" :profile-id="currentSheet.recommendedProfileId!" :workbook-review-id="review?.id" :sensitive-access-confirmed="sensitiveConfirmed" :participants="participants" :source-name="currentSheet.recommendedProfileName||currentSheet.sheetName" :sheet-name="currentSheet.sheetName" :ignored-sheets="excludedSheets" auto-start preparation-only @prepared="markSourcePrepared" @review-state="setCurrentSourceReady" @participant-created="loadParticipants" @profile-updated="refreshInventoryAfterProfile" @edit-profile-requested="configureSheet(currentSheet!)" />
        <div class="source-navigation"><v-btn v-if="currentSourceIndex>0" variant="text" @click="currentSourceIndex--">Fonte anterior</v-btn><v-btn v-if="currentSourceReady&&currentSourceIndex<selectedSheets.length-1" color="primary" @click="currentSourceIndex++">Próxima fonte</v-btn><v-btn v-else-if="allSourcesReady" color="primary" :loading="acting" @click="prepareSources">Preparar lote completo</v-btn></div>
      </template>
      <template v-else-if="step===3 && review?.status==='DRAFT'">
        <p class="eyebrow">Conferência</p><h2>Fontes preparadas</h2><p>O staging ainda está invisível ao cálculo. O preflight revalida versão, perfis, participantes, acesso e sobreposição.</p>
        <dl class="summary"><div><dt>Fontes materializadas</dt><dd>{{ materializedCount }}/{{ review.selectedSourceCount }}</dd></div><div><dt>Itens preparados</dt><dd>{{ totalCandidates }}</dd></div><div><dt>Expiração do staging</dt><dd>{{ formatDate(review.stagingExpiresAt) }}</dd></div></dl>
        <section v-if="sourceUpdateTarget" class="source-update-panel" aria-labelledby="source-update-title">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">Atualização incremental</p><h3 id="source-update-title">Atualizar somente {{ sourceUpdateTarget.sheetName }}</h3></div>
          <p>O arquivo será usado apenas para comparar esta fonte. As demais fontes e decisões permanecem intactas.</p>
          <v-file-input v-model="sourceUpdateInput" accept=".xlsx,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet" label="Workbook com a versão atualizada" prepend-icon="mdi-file-compare-outline" :disabled="acting" @update:model-value="sourceUpdatePreview=null" />
          <div v-if="sourceUpdatePreview" class="source-update-preview" role="status">
            <strong>Prévia sem alteração do lote</strong>
            <dl class="summary"><div><dt>Sem alteração</dt><dd>{{ sourceUpdatePreview.unchangedItems }}</dd></div><div><dt>Valores ou destinos alterados</dt><dd>{{ sourceUpdatePreview.changedItems }}</dd></div><div><dt>Novos</dt><dd>{{ sourceUpdatePreview.addedItems }}</dd></div><div><dt>Removidos</dt><dd>{{ sourceUpdatePreview.removedItems }}</dd></div><div><dt>Total atual</dt><dd>{{ money(sourceUpdatePreview.currentAdditionTotal-sourceUpdatePreview.currentReversalTotal) }}</dd></div><div><dt>Novo total</dt><dd>{{ money(sourceUpdatePreview.proposedAdditionTotal-sourceUpdatePreview.proposedReversalTotal) }}</dd></div><div><dt>Decisões reaproveitadas</dt><dd>{{ sourceUpdatePreview.reusedDecisionCount }}</dd></div><div><dt>Decisões para revisar</dt><dd>{{ sourceUpdatePreview.invalidatedDecisionCount }}</dd></div></dl>
            <div v-if="sourceUpdatePreview.blockingReasons.length" class="notice"><strong>A atualização exigirá revisão</strong><p>{{ sourceUpdatePreview.blockingReasons.join(' ') }}</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="inline-actions"><v-btn v-if="!sourceUpdatePreview" color="primary" variant="tonal" :disabled="!sourceUpdateFile" :loading="acting" @click="previewSourceUpdate">Comparar esta fonte</v-btn><v-btn v-else color="primary" :loading="acting" @click="applySourceUpdate">{{ sourceUpdatePreview.readyToApply?'Aplicar atualização':'Aplicar e revisar pendências' }}</v-btn><v-btn variant="text" :disabled="acting" @click="cancelSourceUpdate">Cancelar</v-btn></div>
        </section>
        <div v-if="sourceReviewRows.length" class="source-resume-list"><strong>Estado de cada fonte</strong><ul><li v-for="source in sourceReviewRows" :key="source.sheet.sheetName"><div><strong>{{ source.sheet.sheetName }}</strong><small>{{ source.materialized?'Pronta para o lote':'Pendente de revisão' }}</small></div><v-chip size="small" :color="source.materialized?'success':'warning'" variant="tonal">{{ source.materialized?'Materializada':'Pendente' }}</v-chip><div class="inline-actions"><v-btn v-if="source.materialized&&source.reviewSource" size="small" variant="text" @click="beginSourceUpdate(source.index)">Atualizar esta fonte</v-btn><v-btn v-if="!source.materialized" size="small" color="primary" variant="tonal" @click="resumeSourceReview(source.index)">Retomar esta fonte</v-btn></div></li></ul></div>
        <div v-if="materializedCount<review.selectedSourceCount" class="notice" role="status"><strong>A revisão das fontes precisa ser concluída</strong><p>Escolha somente a fonte pendente. Fontes já materializadas permanecem preservadas.</p></div><v-btn color="primary" :disabled="Boolean(sourceUpdateTarget)" :loading="acting" @click="materializedCount<review.selectedSourceCount?continuePreparedSourceReview():runPreflight()">{{ materializedCount<review.selectedSourceCount?'Retomar primeira fonte pendente':'Conferir importação' }}</v-btn>
      </template>
      <template v-else-if="step===4 && review && ['PREFLIGHT_READY','PUBLISH_FAILED'].includes(review.status)">
        <p class="eyebrow">Materialização do lote</p><h2>{{ review.status==='PUBLISH_FAILED'?'Retomar materialização':'Materializar fontes' }}</h2><p>A revisão operacional já foi concluída. O preflight congelou as fontes e os totais abaixo; continuar cria itens canônicos editáveis para aplicar regras e calcular. A publicação financeira auditável ocorre somente após a revisão do cálculo.</p><div v-if="review.status==='PUBLISH_FAILED'" class="notice"><strong>A tentativa anterior não foi concluída</strong><p>Nenhum item parcial ficou visível. Você pode voltar à revisão sem descartar as decisões já registradas.</p></div><dl class="summary"><div><dt>Fontes</dt><dd>{{ preflight?.sourceCount ?? review.selectedSourceCount }}</dd></div><div><dt>Itens</dt><dd>{{ preflight?.itemCount ?? totalCandidates }}</dd></div><div><dt>Total de adições</dt><dd>{{ money(preflight?.additionTotal ?? totalAdditions) }}</dd></div><div><dt>Total de reversões</dt><dd>{{ money(preflight?.reversalTotal ?? totalReversals) }}</dd></div></dl><details class="review-summary"><summary>Ver resumo da revisão</summary><p>Mapeamentos de participantes, exclusões justificadas e decisões de multiplicidade permanecem auditados. Esta tela exibe apenas agregados seguros.</p><ul><li v-for="source in review.sources" :key="source.sourceKey"><strong>{{ source.sourceKey }}</strong><span>{{ source.candidateCount }} item(ns) · adições {{ money(source.additionTotal) }} · reversões {{ money(source.reversalTotal) }}</span></li></ul></details><v-checkbox v-model="financialConfirmed" label="Confirmo que estas fontes entram na revisão do cálculo" hide-details /><div class="publication-actions"><v-btn variant="tonal" :disabled="acting" @click="reopenForReview">Voltar à revisão</v-btn><v-btn color="primary" :disabled="!financialConfirmed" :loading="acting" @click="publish">Materializar fontes</v-btn><v-btn variant="text" color="error" :disabled="acting" @click="restartReviewedImport">Descartar revisão e recomeçar</v-btn></div>
      </template>
    </main>
    <div v-if="conflictNeedsAbandon" class="conflict-actions"><v-btn color="error" variant="tonal" @click="abandonReview">Abandonar revisão anterior</v-btn><v-btn variant="text" @click="backToPanel">Voltar ao painel</v-btn></div>
    <footer v-if="!published" class="sticky-action"><span>{{ stepHint }}</span><v-btn variant="text" @click="backToPanel">Salvar e sair</v-btn></footer>
  </div></div>
</template>

<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed, onBeforeUnmount, onMounted, ref, watch } from 'vue'
import { useRoute, useRouter } from 'vue-router'
import { useUserStore } from '@/plugins/userStore'
import AlertStrip from '@/components/AlertStrip.vue'
import GuidedTabularImportReview from '@/components/GuidedTabularImportReview.vue'
import ClosingSourceProfileConfiguration from '@/components/ClosingSourceProfileConfiguration.vue'
import FinancialClosingService,{type ClosingParticipant,type FinancialClosing,type GuidedImportReview,type ImportReadiness,type WorkbookInventory,type WorkbookPreflight,type WorkbookPublication,type WorkbookReview,type WorkbookReviewProgress,type WorkbookSheetInventory,type WorkbookSourceUpdatePreview} from '@/services/FinancialClosingService'

const route=useRoute(),router=useRouter(),userStore=useUserStore();const closing=ref<FinancialClosing|null>(null),review=ref<WorkbookReview|null>(null),progress=ref<WorkbookReviewProgress|null>(null),inventory=ref<WorkbookInventory|null>(null),importReadiness=ref<ImportReadiness|null>(null),preflight=ref<WorkbookPreflight|null>(null),publication=ref<WorkbookPublication|null>(null),participants=ref<ClosingParticipant[]>([]),workbookInput=ref<File|File[]|null>(null),loading=ref(true),acting=ref(false),enablingOwnerSensitiveAccess=ref(false),errorMessage=ref(''),sensitiveConfirmed=ref(false),sensitiveIntentActive=ref(false),financialConfirmed=ref(false),resumed=ref(false),excludedNames=ref<string[]>([]),additionalSheetNames=ref<string[]>([]),readyProfileIds=ref<string[]>([]),currentSourceIndex=ref(-1),conflictNeedsAbandon=ref(false),ownerSensitiveAccessNeeded=ref(false),workbookRecoveryRequired=ref(false),configuringSheet=ref<WorkbookSheetInventory|null>(null),sourceUpdateTarget=ref<{index:number;reviewSourceId:string;sourceKey:string;sheetName:string}|null>(null),sourceUpdateInput=ref<File|File[]|null>(null),sourceUpdatePreview=ref<WorkbookSourceUpdatePreview|null>(null)
const routeReviewId=computed(()=>String(route.params.reviewId||'new'));const selectedFile=computed(()=>Array.isArray(workbookInput.value)?workbookInput.value[0]||null:workbookInput.value);const importedSourceKeys=computed(()=>new Set((importReadiness.value?.sources||[]).filter(source=>(source.sourceStatus||source.status||'').endsWith('_PUBLISHED')||source.status==='IMPORTED').map(source=>source.sourceKey)));const alreadyPublishedSheets=computed(()=>inventory.value?.sheets.filter(sheet=>sheet.selectionStatus==='AUTO_SELECTED'&&sheet.recommendedProfileId&&importedSourceKeys.value.has(sheet.suggestedSourceKey))||[]);const selectedSheets=computed(()=>inventory.value?.sheets.filter(sheet=>sheet.selectionStatus==='AUTO_SELECTED'&&sheet.recommendedProfileId&&(!importedSourceKeys.value.has(sheet.suggestedSourceKey)||additionalSheetNames.value.includes(sheet.sheetName))&&!excludedNames.value.includes(sheet.sheetName))||[]);const reviewSheets=computed(()=>inventory.value?.sheets.filter(sheet=>sheet.selectionStatus==='REVIEW_REQUIRED'&&!excludedNames.value.includes(sheet.sheetName))||[]);const consolidationSheets=computed(()=>inventory.value?.sheets.filter(sheet=>sheet.selectionStatus==='CONSOLIDATION'||sheet.classification==='CONSOLIDATION')||[]);const excludedSheets=computed(()=>inventory.value?.sheets.filter(sheet=>excludedNames.value.includes(sheet.sheetName)).map(sheet=>sheet.sheetName)||[]);const currentSheet=computed(()=>currentSourceIndex.value>=0?selectedSheets.value[currentSourceIndex.value]||null:null);const currentSourceReady=computed(()=>Boolean(currentSheet.value?.recommendedProfileId&&readyProfileIds.value.includes(currentSheet.value.recommendedProfileId)));const allSourcesReady=computed(()=>selectedSheets.value.length>0&&selectedSheets.value.every(sheet=>readyProfileIds.value.includes(sheet.recommendedProfileId!)))
const published=computed(()=>review.value?.status==='PUBLISHED'||progress.value?.status==='PUBLISHED'||Boolean(publication.value));const expiredReview=computed(()=>progress.value?.reviewExpired||review.value?.status==='EXPIRED');const needsResumeIntent=computed(()=>Boolean(routeReviewId.value!=='new'&&review.value&&!published.value&&!expiredReview.value&&!sensitiveIntentActive.value));const stagingExpired=computed(()=>progress.value?.stagingExpired||Boolean(review.value&&new Date(review.value.stagingExpiresAt)<=new Date()));const materializedCount=computed(()=>review.value?.sources.filter(source=>['MATERIALIZED','PUBLISHED'].includes(source.status)).length||0);const sourceReviewRows=computed(()=>selectedSheets.value.map((sheet,index)=>{const reviewSource=review.value?.sources.find(source=>source.sourceKey===sheet.suggestedSourceKey);return{sheet,index,reviewSource,materialized:['MATERIALIZED','PUBLISHED'].includes(reviewSource?.status||'')}}));const sourceUpdateFile=computed(()=>Array.isArray(sourceUpdateInput.value)?sourceUpdateInput.value[0]||null:sourceUpdateInput.value);const reviewNeedsWorkbook=computed(()=>Boolean(review.value&&!['PREFLIGHT_READY','PUBLISH_FAILED'].includes(review.value.status)));const needsWorkbookRecovery=computed(()=>Boolean(reviewNeedsWorkbook.value&&!published.value&&!needsResumeIntent.value&&(workbookRecoveryRequired.value||!selectedFile.value)));const totalCandidates=computed(()=>review.value?.sources.reduce((sum,source)=>sum+source.candidateCount,0)||0);const totalAdditions=computed(()=>review.value?.sources.reduce((sum,source)=>sum+source.additionTotal,0)||0);const totalReversals=computed(()=>review.value?.sources.reduce((sum,source)=>sum+source.reversalTotal,0)||0)
const step=computed(()=>published.value?4:review.value&&['PREFLIGHT_READY','PUBLISH_FAILED'].includes(review.value.status)?4:currentSourceIndex.value>=0?2:review.value&&review.value.selectedSourceCount>0?3:inventory.value?2:1);const competenceLabel=computed(()=>closing.value?`${String(closing.value.periodMonth).padStart(2,'0')}/${closing.value.periodYear} · ${closing.value.closingKey}`:'Apuração');const stepHint=computed(()=>['','Selecione o arquivo uma vez nesta sessão.','Revise uma fonte por vez; nada entrou na base ainda.','O staging ainda não afeta o cálculo.','A materialização é atômica e idempotente.'][step.value])
function clearWorkbook(){workbookInput.value=null;sourceUpdateInput.value=null;sourceUpdatePreview.value=null;sourceUpdateTarget.value=null;sensitiveConfirmed.value=false}
async function initialize(){loading.value=true;try{const all=(await FinancialClosingService.list()).data;closing.value=all.find(item=>item.id===String(route.params.closingId))||null;if(!closing.value)throw new Error('missing closing');await Promise.all([loadParticipants(),loadImportReadiness()]);if(routeReviewId.value!=='new'){progress.value=(await FinancialClosingService.workbookReviewProgress(closing.value.id,routeReviewId.value)).data;review.value={...progress.value,preflightHmac:null,sources:[]} as WorkbookReview;resumed.value=true;if(progress.value.status==='PUBLISHED')sensitiveIntentActive.value=true}}catch{errorMessage.value='Não foi possível abrir esta revisão no workspace atual.'}finally{loading.value=false}}
async function loadParticipants(){if(closing.value)participants.value=(await FinancialClosingService.participants(closing.value)).data}
async function loadImportReadiness(){if(!closing.value)return;try{importReadiness.value=(await FinancialClosingService.importReadiness(closing.value)).data}catch{importReadiness.value=null}}
async function resumeReview(){if(!closing.value)return;acting.value=true;errorMessage.value='';try{await FinancialClosingService.confirmWorkbookSensitiveIntent(closing.value.id,routeReviewId.value);review.value=(await FinancialClosingService.workbookReview(closing.value.id,routeReviewId.value)).data;progress.value=(await FinancialClosingService.workbookReviewProgress(closing.value.id,routeReviewId.value)).data;try{inventory.value=(await FinancialClosingService.workbookReviewInventory(closing.value.id,routeReviewId.value)).data}catch{inventory.value=null}sensitiveIntentActive.value=true;resumed.value=true}catch{errorMessage.value='O acesso expirou, foi revogado ou a revisão não está mais disponível.'}finally{acting.value=false}}
async function inventoryWorkbook(preserveJourney=false){if(!closing.value||!selectedFile.value)return;acting.value=true;errorMessage.value='';ownerSensitiveAccessNeeded.value=false;try{const response=(await FinancialClosingService.initiateWorkbookReview(closing.value,selectedFile.value,true)).data;review.value=response.review;progress.value=null;inventory.value=response.inventory;sensitiveIntentActive.value=true;resumed.value=true;await loadImportReadiness();currentSourceIndex.value=-1;if(!preserveJourney){readyProfileIds.value=[];excludedNames.value=[];additionalSheetNames.value=[]}else{const currentProfileIds=new Set(response.inventory.sheets.map(sheet=>sheet.recommendedProfileId).filter(Boolean));const currentSheetNames=new Set(response.inventory.sheets.map(sheet=>sheet.sheetName));readyProfileIds.value=readyProfileIds.value.filter(id=>currentProfileIds.has(id));excludedNames.value=excludedNames.value.filter(name=>currentSheetNames.has(name));additionalSheetNames.value=additionalSheetNames.value.filter(name=>currentSheetNames.has(name))}await router.replace({name:'closing-import-wizard',params:{closingId:closing.value.id,reviewId:review.value.id}});if(!selectedSheets.value.length&&!reviewSheets.value.length&&!alreadyPublishedSheets.value.length)errorMessage.value='Nenhuma fonte está pendente para importar nesta competência.'}catch(error:any){const owner=userStore.getTenantRole==='ROLE_OWNER';ownerSensitiveAccessNeeded.value=owner&&error?.response?.status===403;errorMessage.value=error?.response?.status===409?'Já existe uma revisão ativa para outro workbook. Retome-a ou abandone-a antes de continuar.':ownerSensitiveAccessNeeded.value?'A leitura exige acesso protegido para este fechamento. Habilite a exceção temporária abaixo e tente novamente.':'Não foi possível ler o workbook. O arquivo não foi armazenado.'}finally{acting.value=false}}
async function enableOwnerSensitiveAccess(){if(!closing.value||!sensitiveConfirmed.value||!userStore.getUser?.id)return;enablingOwnerSensitiveAccess.value=true;errorMessage.value='';try{await FinancialClosingService.grantSensitiveAccess(closing.value,userStore.getUser.id,true);ownerSensitiveAccessNeeded.value=false;errorMessage.value='Acesso protegido habilitado para este fechamento. Agora identifique as fontes do workbook.'}catch{errorMessage.value='Não foi possível habilitar o acesso protegido deste fechamento.'}finally{enablingOwnerSensitiveAccess.value=false}}
function beginSourceReview(){currentSourceIndex.value=0}function excludeSheet(name:string){if(!excludedNames.value.includes(name))excludedNames.value=[...excludedNames.value,name];additionalSheetNames.value=additionalSheetNames.value.filter(item=>item!==name);if(currentSourceIndex.value>=selectedSheets.value.length)currentSourceIndex.value=Math.max(-1,selectedSheets.value.length-1)}function toggleAdditionalSheet(name:string){additionalSheetNames.value=additionalSheetNames.value.includes(name)?additionalSheetNames.value.filter(item=>item!==name):[...additionalSheetNames.value,name];excludedNames.value=excludedNames.value.filter(item=>item!==name);currentSourceIndex.value=-1}function markSourcePrepared(_:GuidedImportReview){const id=currentSheet.value?.recommendedProfileId;if(id&&!readyProfileIds.value.includes(id))readyProfileIds.value=[...readyProfileIds.value,id]}function setCurrentSourceReady(ready:boolean){const id=currentSheet.value?.recommendedProfileId;if(!id)return;readyProfileIds.value=ready?[...new Set([...readyProfileIds.value,id])]:readyProfileIds.value.filter(value=>value!==id)}function sheetStatus(sheet:WorkbookSheetInventory){if(excludedNames.value.includes(sheet.sheetName))return 'EXCLUDED';if(sheet.selectionStatus==='CONSOLIDATION')return 'REFERENCE_ONLY';if(sheet.selectionStatus==='AUTO_SELECTED'&&importedSourceKeys.value.has(sheet.suggestedSourceKey))return additionalSheetNames.value.includes(sheet.sheetName)?'ADDITIONAL_BATCH':'ALREADY_PUBLISHED';if(sheet.selectionStatus==='AUTO_SELECTED')return 'READY_TO_PREPARE';return sheet.reviewReason||'CONFIGURATION_REQUIRED'}function configureSheet(sheet:WorkbookSheetInventory){configuringSheet.value=sheet;currentSourceIndex.value=-1}async function handleSourceProfileSaved(_:string){configuringSheet.value=null;if(!selectedFile.value){errorMessage.value='O perfil foi salvo. Selecione novamente o mesmo workbook para atualizar o inventário desta revisão.';return}await inventoryWorkbook(true)}
async function prepareSources(){if(!closing.value||!selectedFile.value||!allSourcesReady.value||!review.value)return;acting.value=true;errorMessage.value='';conflictNeedsAbandon.value=false;try{review.value=(await FinancialClosingService.prepareWorkbookReview(closing.value,selectedFile.value,selectedSheets.value.map(sheet=>sheet.recommendedProfileId!),review.value.id)).data;currentSourceIndex.value=-1;progress.value=null;resumed.value=true}catch(error:any){if(error?.response?.status===409){errorMessage.value='O arquivo ou a seleção não corresponde à revisão retomada. Decisões anteriores não foram reaproveitadas.';conflictNeedsAbandon.value=true}else errorMessage.value='Ainda existem pendências em uma das fontes. Nenhum item foi publicado.'}finally{acting.value=false}}
async function recoverStaging(){if(!closing.value||!selectedFile.value||!review.value)return;acting.value=true;errorMessage.value='';try{inventory.value=(await FinancialClosingService.workbookInventory(closing.value,selectedFile.value,true)).data;const selectedKeys=new Set(review.value.sources.map(source=>source.sourceKey));const profiles=inventory.value.sheets.filter(sheet=>sheet.selectionStatus==='AUTO_SELECTED'&&sheet.recommendedProfileId&&selectedKeys.has(sheet.suggestedSourceKey)).map(sheet=>sheet.recommendedProfileId!);if(profiles.length!==review.value.selectedSourceCount)throw {response:{status:409}};review.value=(await FinancialClosingService.prepareWorkbookReview(closing.value,selectedFile.value,profiles,routeReviewId.value)).data;progress.value=(await FinancialClosingService.workbookReviewProgress(closing.value.id,routeReviewId.value)).data}catch(error:any){errorMessage.value=error?.response?.status===409?'Este não é o mesmo workbook ou a seleção de fontes mudou. Nenhuma decisão foi reaplicada.':'Não foi possível reconstruir o staging.';conflictNeedsAbandon.value=error?.response?.status===409}finally{acting.value=false}}
async function recoverWorkbook(){workbookRecoveryRequired.value=false;if(review.value?.selectedSourceCount===0){await inventoryWorkbook(true);return}await recoverStaging()}
function selectedReviewProfileIds(){if(!review.value||!inventory.value)return[];const selectedKeys=new Set(review.value.sources.map(source=>source.sourceKey));return inventory.value.sheets.filter(sheet=>selectedKeys.has(sheet.suggestedSourceKey)&&sheet.recommendedProfileId).map(sheet=>sheet.recommendedProfileId!)}
function resumeSourceReview(index:number){const source=sourceReviewRows.value[index];if(!source||source.materialized)return;readyProfileIds.value=sourceReviewRows.value.filter(value=>value.materialized).map(value=>value.sheet.recommendedProfileId!).filter(Boolean);currentSourceIndex.value=index;errorMessage.value='Revise somente esta fonte. As fontes materializadas e suas decisões permanecem preservadas.'}function continuePreparedSourceReview(){const pending=sourceReviewRows.value.find(source=>!source.materialized);if(pending){resumeSourceReview(pending.index);return}errorMessage.value='Não foi encontrada uma fonte pendente para revisão.'}
function beginSourceUpdate(index:number){const source=sourceReviewRows.value[index];if(!source?.reviewSource||!source.materialized)return;sourceUpdateTarget.value={index,reviewSourceId:source.reviewSource.id,sourceKey:source.reviewSource.sourceKey,sheetName:source.sheet.sheetName};sourceUpdateInput.value=null;sourceUpdatePreview.value=null;errorMessage.value='Selecione o workbook atualizado. A prévia comparará somente esta fonte e não alterará o lote.'}
function cancelSourceUpdate(){sourceUpdateTarget.value=null;sourceUpdateInput.value=null;sourceUpdatePreview.value=null}
async function previewSourceUpdate(){if(!closing.value||!review.value||!sourceUpdateTarget.value||!sourceUpdateFile.value)return;acting.value=true;errorMessage.value='';try{sourceUpdatePreview.value=(await FinancialClosingService.previewWorkbookSourceUpdate(closing.value.id,review.value.id,sourceUpdateTarget.value.reviewSourceId,sourceUpdateFile.value,review.value.revision)).data}catch(error:any){sourceUpdatePreview.value=null;errorMessage.value=error?.response?.status===409?'A revisão mudou ou o arquivo não corresponde à estrutura desta fonte. Atualize a tela e tente novamente.':'Não foi possível comparar esta fonte. O lote não foi alterado.'}finally{acting.value=false}}
async function applySourceUpdate(){if(!closing.value||!review.value||!sourceUpdateTarget.value||!sourceUpdateFile.value||!sourceUpdatePreview.value)return;acting.value=true;errorMessage.value='';const target=sourceUpdateTarget.value,file=sourceUpdateFile.value;try{const result=(await FinancialClosingService.applyWorkbookSourceUpdate(closing.value.id,review.value.id,target.reviewSourceId,file,review.value.revision,sourceUpdatePreview.value.previewFingerprint)).data;review.value=result.review;preflight.value=null;progress.value=null;if(result.guidedReview.readyForConfirmation){errorMessage.value=`A fonte ${target.sheetName} foi atualizada. As demais fontes permaneceram intactas.`;cancelSourceUpdate()}else{workbookInput.value=file;sensitiveConfirmed.value=true;readyProfileIds.value=readyProfileIds.value.filter(id=>id!==sourceReviewRows.value[target.index]?.sheet.recommendedProfileId);currentSourceIndex.value=target.index;cancelSourceUpdate();errorMessage.value='A nova versão da fonte foi aplicada. Revise somente as pendências incompatíveis; as decisões seguras já foram reaproveitadas.'}}catch(error:any){errorMessage.value=error?.response?.status===409?'A prévia ficou desatualizada. Compare o arquivo novamente antes de aplicar.':'Não foi possível aplicar a atualização. A versão anterior da fonte foi preservada.'}finally{acting.value=false}}
async function runPreflight(){if(!closing.value||!review.value)return;acting.value=true;errorMessage.value='';try{if(materializedCount.value<review.value.selectedSourceCount){if(!selectedFile.value)throw {response:{status:409},code:'WORKBOOK_REQUIRED'};const profiles=selectedReviewProfileIds();if(profiles.length!==review.value.selectedSourceCount)throw {response:{status:409},code:'SOURCE_SELECTION_CHANGED'};review.value=(await FinancialClosingService.prepareWorkbookReview(closing.value,selectedFile.value,profiles,review.value.id)).data;if(materializedCount.value!==review.value.selectedSourceCount)throw {response:{status:409},code:'MATERIALIZATION_INCOMPLETE'}}preflight.value=(await FinancialClosingService.preflightWorkbookReview(closing.value.id,review.value.id,review.value.revision)).data;review.value=(await FinancialClosingService.workbookReview(closing.value.id,review.value.id)).data}catch(error:any){if(error?.response?.status===422){readyProfileIds.value=[];currentSourceIndex.value=0;errorMessage.value='Uma ou mais fontes ainda têm decisões pendentes. Continue a revisão assistida; as decisões já salvas foram preservadas.'}else errorMessage.value=error?.response?.status===403?'A autorização sensível expirou ou foi revogada. Retome a revisão antes de continuar.':error?.response?.status===409?'A preparação não pôde ser concluída com este workbook. Atualize a revisão e confira as fontes selecionadas.':'Não foi possível concluir a conferência.'}finally{acting.value=false}}
async function publish(){if(!closing.value||!review.value||!review.value.preflightHmac)return;acting.value=true;errorMessage.value='';try{const storageKey=`closing-workbook-publication:${review.value.id}`;let key=sessionStorage.getItem(storageKey);if(!key){key=crypto.randomUUID();sessionStorage.setItem(storageKey,key)}publication.value=(await FinancialClosingService.publishWorkbookReview(closing.value.id,review.value.id,{expectedRevision:review.value.revision,preflightHmac:review.value.preflightHmac,idempotencyKey:key})).data;review.value=(await FinancialClosingService.workbookReview(closing.value.id,review.value.id)).data;clearWorkbook()}catch(error:any){errorMessage.value=error?.response?.status===403?'A autorização sensível expirou ou foi revogada. Retome antes de publicar.':error?.response?.status===409?'O preflight ficou desatualizado. Reabra a conferência antes de tentar novamente.':'A publicação não foi concluída; nenhum item parcial ficou visível.'}finally{acting.value=false}}
async function reopenForReview(){if(!closing.value||!review.value)return;acting.value=true;errorMessage.value='';try{const current=(await FinancialClosingService.workbookReview(closing.value.id,review.value.id)).data;review.value=(await FinancialClosingService.reopenWorkbookReview(closing.value.id,current.id,current.revision)).data;preflight.value=null;financialConfirmed.value=false;currentSourceIndex.value=-1;workbookRecoveryRequired.value=true;clearWorkbook();errorMessage.value='Preflight invalidado. As decisões foram preservadas; selecione novamente o workbook para retomar a fonte necessária.'}catch(error:any){errorMessage.value=error?.response?.status===409?'A revisão mudou enquanto era reaberta. Atualize a tela e tente novamente.':'Não foi possível reabrir a revisão sem descartar o lote.'}finally{acting.value=false}}
async function abandonReview(){if(!closing.value||!review.value)return;acting.value=true;try{await FinancialClosingService.abandonWorkbookReview(closing.value.id,review.value.id,review.value.revision);startNewReview()}catch{errorMessage.value='A revisão mudou ou já é terminal. Atualize o painel antes de abandonar.'}finally{acting.value=false}}
function startNewReview(){router.replace({name:'closing-import-wizard',params:{closingId:closing.value?.id,reviewId:'new'}});review.value=null;progress.value=null;inventory.value=null;preflight.value=null;publication.value=null;readyProfileIds.value=[];excludedNames.value=[];additionalSheetNames.value=[];workbookRecoveryRequired.value=false;clearWorkbook();sensitiveIntentActive.value=false;resumed.value=false;conflictNeedsAbandon.value=false;ownerSensitiveAccessNeeded.value=false;configuringSheet.value=null}
function startAdditionalImport(){startNewReview()}
async function restartReviewedImport(){if(!window.confirm('Esta revisão preparada será descartada. Nenhum item deste staging foi publicado. Deseja recomeçar?'))return;await abandonReview()}
async function refreshInventoryAfterProfile(){if(selectedFile.value)await inventoryWorkbook(true)}
function backToPanel(){clearWorkbook();router.push({name:'planning-financial-closings',query:{closingId:closing.value?.id}})}function money(value:number){return new Intl.NumberFormat('pt-BR',{style:'currency',currency:'BRL'}).format(value)}function formatDate(value:string){return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('pt-BR',{dateStyle:'short',timeStyle:'short'}).format(new Date(value))}onMounted(initialize);onBeforeUnmount(clearWorkbook);watch(()=>routeReviewId.value,()=>{if(routeReviewId.value!=='new'&&!review.value)void initialize()});watch(()=>[userStore.getCurrentWorkspaceId,userStore.isAuthenticated] as const,([workspaceId,authenticated])=>{if(!authenticated||workspaceId!==closing.value?.workspaceId)clearWorkbook()})
</script>

